  "body": "I think this API has more potential usage, if we expand on what can be supported.\r\n\r\nFor example, if we support scheme:\r\n```\r\nnew URLPattern({\r\n    scheme: 'https',\r\n  })\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis can be used to pass to [Sanitizer API](https://github.com/WICG/sanitizer-api) for pattern matching against `a['href']`, `iframe['src']`, etc.\r\n\r\nSimilarly, if we can support host or origin:\r\n```\r\nnew URLPattern({\r\n    origin: 'https://example.com',\r\n  })\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis can be again used to pass to Sanitizer API for pattern matching against `form['action']`.\r\n\r\nCC: @otherdaniel ",
